message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "VA Calibration Platform: a web platform for verbal autopsy processing and cause-of-death calibration"
abstract: >-
  Web platform for processing WHO-standardized verbal autopsy (VA) data and
  calibrating cause-of-death classifications. Provides a backend service,
  frontend, and Kubernetes deployment around the openVA and vacalibration
  R packages.
